@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<h1 class="fw-bold mt-3">About Us</h1>
<p class="text-muted mb-4">
    We are Group 2 from ISM6225 (Application Development for Analytics).
    For this project we built a <strong>Stock Portfolio Tracker</strong> where users can
    add stocks to a watchlist, set target prices, and compare them to live closing
    prices from the Polygon.io API.
</p>

